# Mobile (React Native) boundaries

- This is **React Native + Expo** (prebuild / dev client). Do **not** use `next/*`, server components,
  SSR, Playwright, or `@podverse/ui`.
- Mobile is a **Tier 5 consumer** — import downward only. See
  [apps/mobile/AGENTS.md](/apps/mobile/AGENTS.md) allowlist/denylist and
  [architecture-tier-dependencies](/.cursor/rules/architecture-tier-dependencies.mdc).
- Do **not** import server/web-only packages: `@podverse/orm`, `@podverse/parser`, `@podverse/mq`,
  `@podverse/helpers-backend`, `@podverse/helpers-browser`, `@podverse/helpers-config`,
  `@podverse/observability`, `@podverse/external-services-*`.
- **Auth:** bearer + secure storage; never cookies / `withCredentials`. See
  [API-CLIENT-BOUNDARIES.md](/docs/development/API-CLIENT-BOUNDARIES.md) and `/auth/mobile/*`.
- Reuse `@podverse/helpers-requests` `req*` wrappers and `@podverse/playback-core` policy. Implement
  transport via a **native bridge** (`NativePlaybackBridge`) — do not edit web
  `useMediaElementBridge` for mobile.
- **Import specifiers (Tier D):** extensionless relative imports in app source. See
  [DOCS-DEVELOPMENT-TOOLING-IMPORT-SPECIFIERS.md § Tier D](/docs/development/tooling/DOCS-DEVELOPMENT-TOOLING-IMPORT-SPECIFIERS.md).
- **E2E:** Maestro or Detox in `apps/mobile/e2e/` — **not** `make e2e_*` (web/management-web only).
  See **mobile-e2e-screenshots** skill.
- **Playback parity:** [DOCS-MOBILE-PROCESS-PLAYBACK-QUEUE-PARITY.md](/docs/proposals/mobile/app-development-process/DOCS-MOBILE-PROCESS-PLAYBACK-QUEUE-PARITY.md).
